            "review_title": "Review at The Laputa - Sky Pub & Chill",
            "review_text": "Tomato Studio\nHanoi, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nGreat place to relax, meet friends and go on a date!\nDec 2023 • Solo\nA quality pub in the city center. Going to the 9th floor, stepping through the door feels like entering your \"universe\". Sipping some wine and chatting, with friends, with the bartender or thinking alone is a great experience I had at The Laputa.\n\nComfortable space, neither noisy nor too quiet. Reasonable prices, bartender drinks will be prepared according to the customer's sweet, sour, salty, and bitter preferences. The name of the drink is also interesting. <3\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten March 6, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
