            "review_title": "Review at The Laputa - Sky Pub & Chill",
            "review_text": "Pruitt L\n4 contributions\n0\nThe Laputa - a very nice cocktail bar in Cau Giay district\nFeb 2024 • Friends\nI used to go to the pubs in Hoan Kiem district, but I just know The Laputa - a very nice cocktail bar in Cau Giay. My personal feelings are as follows:\n- Drinks 8.5 points\n- Chill music 9 points (I like the deeper style more, but maybe not for the majority :))))\n- Enthusiastic staff 9 points, a little more would be good\n- View 10 points with no buts. I swear the view is truly excellent, everywhere you sit there are beautiful photos\nVote for couples who come here for a date or in a small group to get to know each other and nothing happens.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 6, 2024",
